lways first. Could ticket include random UUID, but no need.\n\nPotential hidden nuance: `unique-ids` Maelstrom workload might have \"generate\" response field `id` translated to `ticket`, and node IDs maybe consumed? Let's run.\n\nLet's init module.", "text": "", "tool_calls": [{"arguments": {"command": "cd /work && go mod init node && go get github.com/jepsen-io/maelstrom/demo/go@v0.0.0-20260710121306-480a8197026d"}, "arguments_error": null, "id": "call_01a2041956e47d12af850924", "name": "shell"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 12224, "output_tokens": 547}}}
